      <Comment>|FRAME: CYCLOARTENOL Cycloartenol| is a precursor for all the steroids produced by plants and diatoms. It is also produced by some prokaryotes, such as the myxobacteria |FRAME: TAX-41| and |FRAME: TAX-43| |CITS: [12519197]|.</Comment>
